sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant PS as Payroll Service
    participant ES as Employee Service
    participant TO as Time Off Service
    participant L as Ledger

    Admin->>PS: run payroll for Sep 1 - Sep 15
    PS->>ES: employees, schedules, pay rates
    PS->>TO: approved time off Sep 1 - 15? holidays?
    TO-->>PS: Alice: Sep 14 sick day 8h (paid). Labor Day Sep 7
    PS->>PS: Alice: 88h scheduled - 8h holiday - 8h time off = 72h worked
    PS->>PS: pay (simplified): gross, benefits, taxes, net
    PS->>TO: publish on_payroll_processed (run_id, Alice 72h, ...)
    TO->>TO: Sick Leave: 72h / 30 x 1h = 2.4h
    TO->>L: ACCRUAL +2.4h, key = payroll:run_id:alice:sick

    Note over Admin,L: Same run published again (retry): hours unchanged, nothing posted
    Admin->>PS: re-run with Alice 80h (correction)
    PS->>TO: publish on_payroll_processed (same run_id, Alice 80h)
    TO->>L: ADJUSTMENT +0.27h (only the difference)
